        },
        {
          "text": "bazoyanikira musi y’izuba n’ukwezi n’ingabo zose z’inyenyeri zo kw ijuru, ivyo bākunda bakabisaba bakabigendanira bakabishishikarira bakabisenga: ntazosubira kwegeranywa ngw ahambge, arikw azoba nk’intabire yometse ku misozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
