        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ amasigarira yose azoba asigaye kur’ uyu muryango mubi azohitamw’ urupfu kuruta kubaho, ni bo bazoba basigaye ahantu hose aho nzoba narabirukaniye, ni jewe Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo mbivuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
